  "description": "Development and location\n\nThe Island is a secure, gated development on the banks of the River Liffey in Chapelizod village, 6km from the city centre. The pharmacy, shops, church and pubs are a 2-minute walk, as is the Phoenix Park. Dublin Bus route 80 runs from the village to the city centre, and the N4 and M50 are close by.\n\nThe apartment\n\n• Second floor, 52m², furnished\n• Open-plan living and dining area with balcony overlooking the River Liffey and the historic Anna Livia Bridge\n• Kitchen with fridge-freezer, oven and hob, dishwasher and microwave\n• Double bedroom with built-in wardrobes\n• Bathroom with bath and shower\n• 1 underground parking space (additional spaces in the development are often advertised for rent separately)",
